        "Occelli",
        "Mezouar",
        "Dorogokupets",
        "Torrent"
       ],
       "year": 2006,
       "source": "Physical Review Letters",
       "volume": "97",
       "locator": "215504",
       "doi": "10.1103/PhysRevLett.97.215504"
      },
      "source_location": "Experimental Methods, pressure determination; Figure 2 discussion",
      "notes": "Fischer and Ozawa pressures use hcp-Fe volume and temperature directly. Fischer recalculated the Seagle and Campbell diamond-cell points from Fe volume using hcp-Fe (Dewaele) or fcc-Fe (Campbell); low-pressure Campbell multi-anvil observations are the stated exception."
     },
     {
      "kind": "equation_of_state",
      "material": "fcc Fe",
      "reference": {
       "authors": [
