       "doi": "10.1016/j.epsl.2009.07.022"
      },
      "source_location": "Fischer (2011) global B1 comparison-data pressure recalculation; Campbell (2009) Equation (5) and Table 1",
      "notes": "Campbell fcc-Fe published parameters are retained in the non-executable fe_fcc_campbell_2009_bm3_mgd source record. Substantial unresolved coefficient-refit discrepancies prevent accepting this as an executable calibration. Preserve Fischer’s low-pressure multi-anvil exception."
     }
    ],
    "recalculation": {
     "status": "missing_calibrant_observations",
     "notes": "The Dewaele hcp-Fe EOS and the available Fischer, Seagle, Ozawa and Campbell observations are bundled. The Campbell fcc-Fe calibration is deferred because of unresolved reproduction discrepancies; it is not available for automatic pressure recalculation. Two Seagle rows also lack iron volumes, and Fischer’s final combined row selection is not tabulated."
    },
